            <ArticleTitle>Working with pain clinics and other consultants concerning low back pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>547-52</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.pop.2012.06.009</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Although primary care physicians are able to manage low back pain, often it is necessary to refer to other specialists. This article reviews how primary care physicians can refer to pain clinics and work with consultants.</AbstractText>
